Laya multilingual checkpoint: https://huggingface.co/aac6fef/laya-multilingual-mlx
Revision f2b4faf51023039425946074e2cf1361d2db11d5, Apache License 2.0; an MLX FP16
conversion of https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual

The checkpoint is not redistributed; the setup scripts download it from Hugging Face.
experiments/ptm45/typed-decisions.pt holds ChipJev's fine-tuned values of 35M of its
parameters (decision head, option scorer, type embedding, final norm and the last four
encoder layers), modified by src/chipjev/decisions/finetune.py.
